{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24789","headline":"七老会诗 · 郑据","name":"七老会诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东洛幽闲日暮春，邀欢多是白头宾。\n官班朱紫多相似，年纪高低次第匀。\n联句每言松竹意，停杯多说古今人。\n更无外事来心肺，空有清虚入思神。\n醉舞两回迎劝酒，狂歌一曲会娱身。\n今朝何事偏情重，同作明时列任臣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑据","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24789.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24789","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}